{"title":"엘의 낙원 [→ side_E →]","artist":"Sound Horizon","sourceId":"reference:aBHSAiymeaGIZdup47Rb","sourceHash":"11d16b608533f92c546b401bba91a991b6ddba0092a9c17a37a515becd68fbc6","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lyric_character_matching","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":2.38,"end":3.52,"text":"「私は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":3.52,"end":7.6,"text":"生涯彼女を愛することはないだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":7.6,"end":8.93,"text":"しかし","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":8.93,"end":11.33,"text":"彼女という存在は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":11.33,"end":15.27,"text":"私にとって特別な意味を孕むだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":15.27,"end":16.89,"text":"何故なら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":16.89,"end":19.31,"text":"生まれてくる娘の名は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":19.31,"end":20.91,"text":"遠い昔にもう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":20.91,"end":24.03,"text":"決めてあるのだから」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":24.03,"end":25.62,"text":"そして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":25.62,"end":28.53,"text":"幾度目かの楽園の扉が開かれる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":36.11,"end":42.29,"text":"(Elysion, hu-ah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":42.29,"end":48.67,"text":"(Elysion, hu-ah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":54.27,"end":60.27,"text":"白い大地に 緋い雫で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":60.27,"end":66.54,"text":"描かれた軌跡 罪の道標","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":66.54,"end":69.01,"text":"古びた金貨","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":69.01,"end":71.88,"text":"握りしめたまま","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":71.88,"end":74.71000000000001,"text":"這い擦りながらも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":74.71000000000001,"end":77.93,"text":"男は笑った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":77.93,"end":81.05,"text":"迴るように 浮かんでくる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":81.05,"end":84.03999999999999,"text":"愛しい笑顏 すぐそこに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":84.03999999999999,"end":87.01,"text":"無限の果てに 手を伸ばす樣に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":87.01,"end":88.95,"text":"扉に手を掛けた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":88.95,"end":91.68,"text":"Come down to the Elysion (そして 彼の現実は朽ち果てる)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":91.68,"end":97.53999999999999,"text":"少女が小さく 咳をする度","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":97.53999999999999,"end":103.37,"text":"胸の痛みがを遠ざける","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":103.37,"end":106.56,"text":"襤褸い(もろい)毛布でも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":106.56,"end":109.7,"text":"夢は見られる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":109.7,"end":115.42,"text":"愛を知った日の温もり忘れない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":115.42,"end":118.46000000000001,"text":"眠るように 沈んでゆく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":118.46000000000001,"end":121.48,"text":"愛しい世界 水底に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":121.48,"end":124.15,"text":"夢幻の果てが 手を招く樣に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":124.15,"end":126.16,"text":"扉は開かれた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":126.16,"end":130.0,"text":"Come down to the Elysion (そして 彼女の現実は砕け散る)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":130.0,"end":133.38,"text":"ねぇ お父樣 その楽園では","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":133.38,"end":136.13,"text":"どんな花がさくの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":136.13,"end":139.4,"text":"ねぇ お父樣 その楽園では","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":139.4,"end":142.17000000000002,"text":"どんな鳥が歌うの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":142.17000000000002,"end":145.36,"text":"ねぇ お父樣 その楽園では","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":145.36,"end":148.12,"text":"体はもう痛くないの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":148.12,"end":151.31,"text":"ねぇ お父樣 その楽園では","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":151.31,"end":155.45,"text":"ずっと一緒にいられるの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":155.45,"end":156.21,"text":"ねぇ お父樣","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":156.21,"end":159.17000000000002,"text":"「窓を叩く夜風 弾む吐息","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":159.17000000000002,"end":162.21,"text":"薄暗い部屋 楽しそうな談笑","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":162.21,"end":164.97,"text":"虚ろな月明かり 白い吐息","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":164.97,"end":168.09,"text":"薄汚い部屋 痩せた膝の少女","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":168.09,"end":171.0,"text":"幾度となく繰り返される問い掛け","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":171.0,"end":174.17000000000002,"text":"つきることのない『楽園』への興味","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":174.17000000000002,"end":177.2,"text":"ああ 少女にはもう見えていないのだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":177.2,"end":179.86,"text":"傍らに横たわるその屍体が」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":204.13,"end":205.22,"text":"「ねえ、パパ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":205.22,"end":206.52,"text":"「なんだい、エル？」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":206.52,"end":208.78,"text":"「明日はなんの日か知ってる？」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":208.78,"end":211.9,"text":"「世界で一番可愛い女の子の誕生日」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":211.9,"end":212.76,"text":"へへへへ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":212.76,"end":216.25,"text":"「私、お誕生日プレゼントは絵本がいいと思うわ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":216.25,"end":219.06,"text":"(Cross door) 男の夢想は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":219.06,"end":222.26,"text":"残酷な現実となり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":222.26,"end":225.28,"text":"(Cross door) 少女の現実は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":225.28,"end":228.23,"text":"幽幻な夢想となる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":228.23,"end":231.22,"text":"(Cross door) 男の楽園は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":231.22,"end":234.23,"text":"永遠の奈落となり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":234.23,"end":237.28,"text":"(Cross door) 少女の奈落は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":237.28,"end":240.04,"text":"束の間の楽園となる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":240.04,"end":243.0,"text":"お父樣その楽園では","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":243.0,"end":245.73,"text":"どんな恋がさくの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":245.73,"end":248.94,"text":"ねぇ お父樣その楽園では","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":248.94,"end":252.08,"text":"どんな愛を歌うの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":252.08,"end":255.07,"text":"お父樣その楽園では","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":255.07,"end":257.76,"text":"心はもう痛くないの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":257.76,"end":260.9,"text":"ねぇ お父樣その楽園では","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":260.9,"end":265.33,"text":"ずっと一緒にいられるの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":265.33,"end":268.37,"text":"ねぇ お父樣 その楽園では","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":268.37,"end":271.26,"text":"どんな花がさくの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":271.26,"end":274.45,"text":"ねぇ お父樣 その楽園では","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":274.45,"end":277.43,"text":"どんな鳥が歌うの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":277.43,"end":280.55,"text":"ねぇ お父樣 その楽園では","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":280.55,"end":283.24,"text":"体はもう痛くないの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":283.24,"end":286.40999999999997,"text":"ねぇ お父樣 その楽園では","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81","start":286.